# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
#
# SHA-256 of every TAK Protocol schema that tak-proto/build.rs compiles, read
# in place from src/takserver-protobuf/src/main/proto (SEC-005). build.rs
# recomputes each digest and fails the build on any difference, so an
# upstream merge that renumbers, retypes or adds a field cannot change the
# generated decoder (or leave the hand encoder in src/lib.rs, which hard-codes
# field numbers and wire types, behind) without a reviewed change here.
#
# Updating: re-run `shasum -a 256 *.proto` in the schema directory, compare
# the schema diff with the hand encoder and the parity map, and have the
# tak-protocol-reviewer approve the change to this file (CM-3, SA-10(1);
# a build-host change detector outside the TOE, not an SI-7 claim).
#
# Format: one `<sha256 hex>  <file name>` line per schema (sha256sum format),
# sorted by name; `#` lines and blank lines are ignored.

